    "createastronautics.ponder.redstone_regulator.header": "Setting signal strength with the Redstone Regulator",
    "createastronautics.ponder.redstone_regulator.text_1": "A Redstone Regulator turns any signal reaching its back into one fixed strength",
    "createastronautics.ponder.redstone_regulator.text_2": "Hold Right-click on its top to pick that strength, anywhere from 0 to 15",
    "createastronautics.ponder.redstone_regulator.text_3": "A weaker signal fades out sooner along the wire",
    "createastronautics.ponder.redstone_regulator.text_4": "With nothing powering its back, it puts out nothing at all",
    "createastronautics.ponder.solid_rocket_booster.header": "Lifting off with Solid Rocket Boosters",
    "createastronautics.ponder.solid_rocket_booster.text_1": "Solid Rocket Boosters push whatever physics structure they are built into",
    "createastronautics.ponder.solid_rocket_booster.text_2": "Fuel is built on, not put in: stack Blocks of Coal on its intake, up to 3 wide and 4 high",
    "createastronautics.ponder.solid_rocket_booster.text_3": "A Redstone signal ignites it - and every other Booster touching a lit one",
    "createastronautics.ponder.solid_rocket_booster.text_4": "Exhaust this close turns the ground to Magma - bars and grates let it pass through instead",
    "createastronautics.ponder.solid_rocket_booster.text_5": "The stack burns away block by block from the top, until it runs out or the signal stops",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_detector.header": "Detecting oxygen with the Oxygen Detector",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_detector.text_1": "The Oxygen Detector checks for breathable air in the block in front of its face",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_detector.text_2": "With no oxygen there, its lights stay red and it gives no signal",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_detector.text_3": "Once there is oxygen in front of it, its lights turn blue and it gives a constant Redstone signal",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_detector.text_4": "The signal comes out of every side except its face",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_detector.text_5": "As soon as the oxygen is gone, the signal turns off again",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_detector.text_6": "A Display Link on it shows whether there is oxygen on a Display Board",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_fan.header": "Keeping a room breathable with the Oxygen Fan",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_fan.text_1": "On the Moon and in Deep Space there is no air to breathe, even indoors",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_fan.text_2": "An Oxygen Fan with a Nozzle on its outlet fills the sealed room the Nozzle sits in",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_fan.text_3": "It needs Oxygen piped into the port on its side to do that",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_fan.text_4": "While it runs, nobody inside the room needs a space suit",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_fan.text_5": "Spinning it faster lets it fill a bigger room, and a bigger room uses more Oxygen",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_fan.text_6": "Any opening to the outside lets all of the air escape",
    "createastronautics.ponder.oxygen_fan.text_7": "Engineer's Goggles show how much room the Fan can fill, and how long its Oxygen will last"
}
